,"id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Community Events, sneak peeks and more!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073990/extras/95e2c2ae555f93e1819e98e12baf600d.avif?t=1773151370\" width=614 height=186 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runeborn is a dark fantasy roguelike that merges deckbuilding with a slot-machine-like mechanic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your Runebook, crush enemies, and combine trinkets of boundless power to destroy the forces of Malakar!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073990/extras/bf92df77fe9d71f651aac1e3061b61d4.avif?t=1773151370\" width=600 height=89 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast spells to attack enemies by spinning Rune Columns like slot reels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match results along five Spell Lines to deal damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically lock up to 8 Runes in place while others spin for better control. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073990/extras/3af58d789361c8fa155dc7607a2dd8bf.poster.avif?t=1773151370\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073990/extras/3af58d789361c8fa155dc7607a2dd8bf.webm?t=1773151370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073990/extras/3af58d789361c8fa155dc7607a2dd8bf.mp4?t=1773151370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span